  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row6Member">同社はボンド事業の原材料の仕入先であり、化成品事業の仕入先および顧客であります。事業上の関係維持・強化を図るため同社株式を継続して保有しています(議決権行使の指図権限を有します)。</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
