&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: left"&gt;１　発行済株式に関する事項&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 578.19999999999999999999999999px; margin-left: auto"&gt;
